            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **What is it?** Half the distance between the centers of two identical atoms bonded covalently.",
            "start": 2927,
            "end": 3024
          },
          {
            "id": "p31",
            "category": "STUDY_SUPPORT",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "recap"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **Why use it?** Atoms are fuzzy; this gives us a reliable way to define an atom's \"size.\"",
            "start": 3025,
            "end": 3116
          },
          {
            "id": "p32",
            "category": "STUDY_SUPPORT",
            "attributes": {
              "subtype": "recap"
            },
            "formats": [
              "list",
              "prose"
            ],
            "review_flags": [],
            "text": "* **Periodic Trend:** ",
            "start": 3117,
